# ============================================================
#  .gitignore — ADP Control for Wheeled Mobile Robot
#  Nguyen tac: KHONG commit thu tai tao duoc tu source.
#  Chi tiet: docs/guides/structure.md
# ============================================================

# ---- Ket qua mo phong (tai tao bang: simulations/sim_*.m) ----
# Cac file .mat rat lon (80-300 MB). GitHub chan cung file > 100 MB.
results/*.mat
results/*.fig

# ---- LaTeX build artifacts (tai tao bang: pdflatex) ----
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.synctex.gz
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.bbl
*.blg
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb
*.run.xml
*.bcf
*.auxlock

# LUU Y: *.pdf KHONG bi ignore.
#   - PDF san pham (thesis.pdf, *_report.pdf) can giu de luu tru.
#   - PDF hinh ve trong docs/**/figures/ can giu de LaTeX compile duoc.

# ---- MATLAB ----
*.asv
*.m~
*.mex*
slprj/
codegen/

# ---- He dieu hanh / editor ----
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# ---- Claude Code ----
.claude/settings.local.json
